// error: global_initializer_with_failing_layout_is_error.kpp:18: error: the layout of Holder: the member inner (`Flex inner`) holds Flex, which has a flexible array member: only a pointer may refer to such an object inside another (in main())
extern "C" int printf(const char* format, ...);
